  "description": "Production-ready .NET library for type-safe mathematical intervals and ranges. Zero-allocation struct-based design with comprehensive set operations (intersection, union, contains, overlaps), explicit infinity support, span-based parsing, and custom interpolated string handler. Generic over IComparable<T> with 100% test coverage. Built for correctness and performance.",
